{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realm of Embervale is lost. In their greed for magical power, your ancestors unleashed a pestilence that consumed the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enshrouded is a game of survival, crafting, and Action RPG combat, set within a sprawling voxel-based continent. As you journey across the mountains and deserts of an open world, you are free to choose your path and shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignite the Ancient power of the Flame, and piece together the fragments of a story that unfolds below the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE SHROUD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing but the will to survive the wilds. You must scrape and scavenge through the ruined remnants of a lost kingdom, and fend off the beasts that hunger for your flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through forests, caves, dungeons, searching for secret knowledge and treasure. Build the strength to venture into the Shroud and bring the fight back to the horrors of the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/1dc7f6629ba171fb30cfc538976a4301.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/1dc7f6629ba171fb30cfc538976a4301.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEART POUNDING ACTION COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shroud consumes the land it corrupts, mutating and guiding all life it encounters. Cleave your way through ravaging factions and formidable bosses, battling Scavenger in the forests, Vukah in the caves, and Fell creatures in the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck, parry, and surprise your foes with unexpected fighting skills and powerful spells. Exploit the weaknesses of your enemies as you develop your own unique playstyle with an in-depth skill tree system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/68d9f133b29003e5f78a9678be946124.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/68d9f133b29003e5f78a9678be946124.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE EPIC BUILDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring life back to the land! Voxel-based building unleashes your creative vision, allowing you to create grand architecture on an epic scale, customized with a vast assortment of materials and furniture. Build not only for yourself, because NPCs will take refuge within your walls, unlocking advanced workshops and the ability to craft epic weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/fc813f408487bf91c76def4243bed2fa.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/fc813f408487bf91c76def4243bed2fa.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT GEAR WORTHY OF LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and customize a staggering array of legendary weapons and armor to become a force to be reckoned with. You'll need to master the shield, the sword, the staff and the bow to withstand the merciless advance of the Shroud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/ed2b477aa06845f31e7c3dfdb71d8c32.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/ed2b477aa06845f31e7c3dfdb71d8c32.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CALL UPON YOUR ALLIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join with friends in 16 player co-op gameplay. Carve out unique roles and complimentary skills that will prove your worth in battle as together you raid, gather treasure, and overcome the Fell hordes that ravage the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/d1c98540e38f961777eebb35d95715c3.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/d1c98540e38f961777eebb35d95715c3.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK THE SECRETS OF A FALLEN REALM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the biomes of Embervale to immerse yourself in vibrant fallen cultures and ancient myths, from the mystical desert of the Kindlewastes to the dark canopies of The Revelwood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the fog, and beneath the ruins of a lost kingdom lies an ever-unfolding story of magic, ruin, hope, and redemption waiting to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Thundering success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/c398f65f0e7cd06bd0f1d2a9c936b08a219856e0.jpg"},{"name":"Dethroned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/7ce3e22e1173963583959a91468b120f66662be3.jpg"},{"name":"Pieces of the past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/3e56f7960be028d56ef641ea90bc418e2a3db993.jpg"},{"name":"A place to call home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/fb9c2ec7a1931dc461db7d7187d000879875e095.jpg"},{"name":"Freefall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/08e86a9f6fe0428fe4e9a333498f22597b1fd3bd.jpg"},{"name":"Shortcut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/f8c376e69afe8881abe2c2ccefd046a7bff6046d.jpg"},{"name":"Thus it begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/b14547c51751556eb86986f0e11bd8eb702c0895.jpg"},{"name":"Winged Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/a10bf1cc79350a5c44584824da4099c40166d3aa.jpg"},{"name":"Spark of the Springlands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/0b13ea48246c87e9c209a0864f9a0605515f2edc.jpg"},{"name":"Spark of the Revelwoods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1203620/49fb214cc436552116579615d16c389bad443d84.jpg"}],"total":45},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1203620?t=1760359696","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760359696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/2680a546499bb54fbcb4ed8ef218a5f5b04bd631/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760359696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/2680a546499bb54fbcb4ed8ef218a5f5b04bd631/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760359696","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check out our Roadmap and what we have integrated so far during Early Access.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/4bc9ce383fb932921143ce970ecb96d4.avif?t=1760359696\" data-has-big width=800 height=1188 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/15a52be97ead2b80aea3915468d8d676.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=1600 /></span></p></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/c3ca1f71acf49c5cffdfc5ab59e99fd1.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/c3ca1f71acf49c5cffdfc5ab59e99fd1.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realm of Embervale is lost. In their greed for magical power, your ancestors unleashed a pestilence that consumed the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enshrouded is a game of survival, crafting, and Action RPG combat, set within a sprawling voxel-based continent. As you journey across the mountains and deserts of an open world, you are free to choose your path and shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignite the Ancient power of the Flame, and piece together the fragments of a story that unfolds below the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE SHROUD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing but the will to survive the wilds. You must scrape and scavenge through the ruined remnants of a lost kingdom, and fend off the beasts that hunger for your flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through forests, caves, dungeons, searching for secret knowledge and treasure. Build the strength to venture into the Shroud and bring the fight back to the horrors of the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/1dc7f6629ba171fb30cfc538976a4301.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/1dc7f6629ba171fb30cfc538976a4301.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEART POUNDING ACTION COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shroud consumes the land it corrupts, mutating and guiding all life it encounters. Cleave your way through ravaging factions and formidable bosses, battling Scavenger in the forests, Vukah in the caves, and Fell creatures in the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck, parry, and surprise your foes with unexpected fighting skills and powerful spells. Exploit the weaknesses of your enemies as you develop your own unique playstyle with an in-depth skill tree system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/68d9f133b29003e5f78a9678be946124.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/68d9f133b29003e5f78a9678be946124.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE EPIC BUILDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring life back to the land! Voxel-based building unleashes your creative vision, allowing you to create grand architecture on an epic scale, customized with a vast assortment of materials and furniture. Build not only for yourself, because NPCs will take refuge within your walls, unlocking advanced workshops and the ability to craft epic weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/fc813f408487bf91c76def4243bed2fa.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/fc813f408487bf91c76def4243bed2fa.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT GEAR WORTHY OF LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and customize a staggering array of legendary weapons and armor to become a force to be reckoned with. You'll need to master the shield, the sword, the staff and the bow to withstand the merciless advance of the Shroud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/ed2b477aa06845f31e7c3dfdb71d8c32.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/ed2b477aa06845f31e7c3dfdb71d8c32.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CALL UPON YOUR ALLIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join with friends in 16 player co-op gameplay. Carve out unique roles and complimentary skills that will prove your worth in battle as together you raid, gather treasure, and overcome the Fell hordes that ravage the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/d1c98540e38f961777eebb35d95715c3.poster.avif?t=1760359696\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/d1c98540e38f961777eebb35d95715c3.webm?t=1760359696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK THE SECRETS OF A FALLEN REALM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the biomes of Embervale to immerse yourself in vibrant fallen cultures and ancient myths, from the mystical desert of the Kindlewastes to the dark canopies of The Revelwood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the fog, and beneath the ruins of a lost kingdom lies an ever-unfolding story of magic, ruin, hope, and redemption waiting to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Keen Games GmbH"],"dlc":[2815510],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/e67cd0b0a988dd61beaf0c9f0782ba0dcc23e0fa/header.jpg?t=1760359696","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>Enshrouded\u00ae</strong> and <strong>Keen\u00ae</strong> are registered trademarks of Keen Games GmbH \u00a92025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1203620/1674239379/ce79cbddab0370f20fa92dfb8e0d1f7495c1d142/1750641612/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757538635","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1203620/1674239379/ce79cbddab0370f20fa92dfb8e0d1f7495c1d142/1750641612/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757538635","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1203620/1674239379/ce79cbddab0370f20fa92dfb8e0d1f7495c1d142/1750641612/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757538635","id":257139185,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139185/movie480.mp4?t=1757538635","max":"https://video.akamai